{"suttaId":"an9.67","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-ix","vriCode":"s0404m2.mul","paras":[453,454],"vripara":"67"},"segments":{"an9.67:0.3":"Orambhāgiyasuttaṃ","an9.67:1.1":"“Pañcimāni, bhikkhave, orambhāgiyāni saṃyojanāni.","an9.67:1.2":"Katamāni pañca?","an9.67:1.3":"Sakkāyadiṭṭhi, vicikicchā, sīlabbataparāmāso, kāmacchando, byāpādo –","an9.67:1.4":"imāni kho, bhikkhave, pañcorambhāgiyāni saṃyojanāni.","an9.67:2.1":"“Imesaṃ kho, bhikkhave, pañcannaṃ orambhāgiyānaṃ saṃyojanānaṃ pahānāya…pe… ime cattāro satipaṭṭhānā bhāvetabbā”ti.","an9.67:2.2":"Pañcamaṃ. 6."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
